{"seq":1,"slug":"a-united-germany","title":"统一的德国","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/otto-von-bismarck/influence-and-legacy/a-united-germany","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-architect-of-germany","title":"德国的缔造者","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/otto-von-bismarck/influence-and-legacy/a-united-germany/the-architect-of-germany","wordCount":1831,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"reshaping-europe","title":"重塑欧洲","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/otto-von-bismarck/influence-and-legacy/a-united-germany/reshaping-europe","wordCount":1761,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 统一的德国\n\n俾斯麦缔造统一德国，深刻改变了德国与欧洲的历史。本章考察这一影响。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"德国的缔造者\"——他结束分裂、为现代德国奠基、塑造其性格的功业。第二篇文档讲述\"重塑欧洲\",呈现强大德国崛起如何打破均势、改变欧洲格局。\n"}